Blank VPN & Proxy assigns reserved IPv4 devices and domain-based services to VPN or
proxy exits on OPNsense. It supports Mullvad account onboarding, compatible
native WireGuard and OpenVPN tunnels, and individually selected proxy servers
from manual entries, links, and subscriptions.

WWW: https://github.com/BlankNetworks/OPNSenseBlankVPN

